he target is asleep and unable to perform most actions.  Every %d damage it takes will reduce the duration of the effect by one turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标陷入睡眠，无法执行大多数行动，每受到 %d 伤害缩短 1 回合持续时间。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"70cefce82a3213c8833278b8e4ac9c213af1a40338a4cc26a060ea64d4d5de69","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"731fe72cba89689077cfdcbfb07d3b21f831a93e9e26c9a1c6c8c1b9ef959673","logical_entry_identity":"b80640fccb28f714726460c1f926f7480cbfd1533d4c2c9ef7c76874acbe807d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Gem Golem","source_tag":"talent name","target":"宝石傀儡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eef00ac96ab7a31fcd66e7c937a57593f65561d673ba2a17cc8fae0a05387eb0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7323536132ef4fe2589d8b83946444a0364c0e42af05da42bf7a6a2dcfc30c4b","logical_entry_identity":"3af1a3e67355532a23d00fcbe64308bf937ea85179df6e1a57d43f3dd4605c41","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Cursed Wound","source_tag":"_t","target":"+诅咒创伤"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cf44699b5b6cb9b3668e9b0fc43849bb56525c926d0f0d942015dc78f1b1e09d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7329f2f2b4a7a343583562bf78a0d1d274b7b6bb3e85c089daf25b5ac690d8e2","logical_entry_identity":"4331e9f2c3e8bfd1198a33d7b604752ba74c25fcea2b80eed14cb534958bfbee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Woven through with fell magics of undeath, these bindings suck the light and life out of everything they touch. Any who don them will find themselves suspended in a nightmarish limbo between life and death.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这些由亡灵邪恶魔法编织的绷带会吸走一切触及之物的光与生命。任何穿上它们的人都会发现自己悬浮在生与死之间的噩梦般地带。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"99e18b3ca3edce8b0ac133c3dffc78af606671b903bc57ffcbdfc90d71b65ef5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"732e6329538ff6a6bcf37493e3ba342369e661c60c3fa60bb8646e53669d82b3","logical_entry_identity":"f28abf18b69f2203016d8dd5fcca669f465ffa96526474d3b52f00a57a685d3b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","sourc